[I] A YAML parser and emitter for Python

[T] A complete YAML 1.1 parser, Unicode support, pickle support, capable
[T] extension API, and sensible error messages. PyYAML supports standard YAML
[T] tags and provides Python-specific tags that allow to represent an arbitrary
[T] Python object.

[U] https://pyyaml.org/

